# Intentionally empty: this fixture contributes no local subtypes. The
# directory exists because `deployment.yaml` declares `schema_dir` and the
# deployment lint refuses a declared path that is not there.
#
# This file carries text rather than being empty on purpose. An empty
# .gitkeep is byte-identical to every other deployment's, and the PACT scope
# gate diffs with `--find-copies-harder`, so an empty one is reported as a
# COPY of an unrelated deployment's file -- which then has to be covered by
# this change's affected_code, or the gate refuses.
